  [38;5;153mconfig.js:3[39m is [38;5;153mSESSION_TIMEOUT_MINUTES: 30[39m, and [38;5;153mserver.js:3[39m confirms it's the live session-expiry value. Going 30m →
  480m is a 16x widening of the window in which a stolen session token, an unlocked laptop, or a shared browser stays
  authenticated. Idle sessions would survive a full workday.

